        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Truncate <computeroutput>vector</computeroutput> (raw array of length <computeroutput>full_dim</computeroutput>) to a vector of length trunc_dim_. If <computeroutput>full_dim</computeroutput> &gt;= trunc_dim_, only the first trunc_dim_ elements are kept. If <computeroutput>full_dim</computeroutput> &lt; trunc_dim_, all available elements are copied and the remaining positions are zero-padded up to trunc_dim_, regardless of normalize_. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
